{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n 先日\n さりなちゃんとカフェに行きました\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHDEKMYNDP4KX4KY5D2XD9F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 少し古いけど\n #彼女とデートなう\n やりました\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHDEMKKA0K4K31BGDQFH6CE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n #彼女がハイテンションなう\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHDENJ9B9XRF9VQ81FMPHDK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 2時間くらい滞在したのですが\n 2時間ひたすら話し続けました\n \n \n 話した内容は\n 全部架空の内容\n \n ない話をある風に話ししてました\n \n \n もう1人の自分になりきって\n 妄想の会話をし続けました\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHDEPH676B6WCHYBYXBGGK6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n #彼女が携帯なう\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHDEQHQS27NPNJ87NPHQYZ7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n #彼女が…\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHDERGPYCTJX6WK92N5M3N8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n #色気出してきたなう\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHDESG61KNNWF0KPWVT1F8X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n #恥ずかしくなって顔を隠したなう\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHDETDQT7DVY98XP8QQZQ80","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n #あれ？なんか私の少ない、、、\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHDEVD1EG639BK45W6DF7E1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 最後はにっこり\n #彼女とカフェなう\n \n \n \n \n \n 以上\n シッターからの報告でした〜"}],"source":"archive"}